1 REM FBCS GFX-0193
2 REM CLAIM A-13.5.2-TR136
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 13.5.2 l.10527-10530, 12.1.4 l.8805-8807: the detached-handler of an EXTERNAL picture draws the picture itself
5 REM without declaring it in its own unit.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE P
20 DRAW P(1)
30 END
100 EXTERNAL PICTURE P(N)
110 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
120   CAUSE EXCEPTION 5
130 END WHEN
140 PRINT "FIN"; N
150 HANDLER H
160   IF N < 2 THEN DRAW P(N + 1)
170 END HANDLER
180 END PICTURE
